# Tadado Design System

## Brand
Modern, premium, playful but not childish. Inspiration: Apple, Linear, Notion, Superhuman. Avoid cartoonish UI.

## Typography
- Font: Plus Jakarta Sans (or Inter, General Sans)
- Hero headline: Large, bold, high impact
- Section headlines: Medium weight
- Body: Clean, readable
- Avoid playful/cartoon fonts

## Colors
- Dark neutral backgrounds (zinc-950, zinc-900)
- Vibrant accent colors from game UI (indigo, violet)
- Soft gradients, intentional use
- Avoid rainbow palettes, childish colors

## Icons
Use Lucide, Phosphor, Heroicons, or Radix. Minimal, thin stroke, geometric, consistent. No emoji or cartoon icons.

## Layout
- Large padding between sections
- Centered content blocks
- Grid layouts for features
- Spacious, breathable sections

## Animation
Subtle: fade-ins, card hovers, gentle transitions. Avoid bouncy cartoon animations.

## Section Order
Hero → Gameplay → How it works → Product differentiation → Vibe → Cards → Premium → Founder offer → Social → Trust → Final CTA
